---
import GuiaLayout from '../../layouts/GuiaLayout.astro';
import { TOTAL } from '../../data/guia/lugares';
---
<GuiaLayout
  title="About the guide — Cometia"
  description="What Cometia is: the local, independent, bilingual guide to bars and restaurants in Gran Alacant, Santa Pola and around."
  lang="en"
  canonical="/en/about"
  altUrl="/sobre"
>
  <section class="ficha wrap">
    <h1>About the guide</h1>
    <div class="prose" style="max-width:720px">
      <p><strong>Cometia</strong> is an independent local guide to the bars, restaurants, pubs and cafés of <strong>Gran Alacant, Santa Pola and the surrounding area</strong> (Costa Blanca). We bring together {TOTAL} local places in one spot, with a map, contact details and a clear description of each.</p>
      <h2>Bilingual, made for the area</h2>
      <p>The whole guide is in <strong>English and Spanish</strong>, because this area is home to both Spanish neighbours and a large international community. Whether you've lived here for years or just arrived, we want it to be easy to find somewhere to eat or grab a drink.</p>
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>Venue data (name, address, type, location) comes from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap</a> and public sources. The <strong>descriptions are our own</strong>, written for this guide. Where we show a rating, we link to its Google listing — we don't copy anyone's reviews.</p>
      <p>Is your place missing, is something wrong, or would you like your venue featured? Get in touch on our <a href="/en/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</GuiaLayout>
